Come on—

292
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,000
Give it to me, I'd feel even better!

293
00:14:27,039 --> 00:14:27,659
Zhuzi,

294
00:14:28,299 --> 00:14:29,240
think bigger.

295
00:14:32,340 --> 00:14:33,120
What now?

296
00:14:33,779 --> 00:14:34,759
Dealing with guys like that

297
00:14:35,059 --> 00:14:35,860
